        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Modern 3-Bedroom Detached House - Available to Rent for Professionals only\n\nA beautifully presented detached house offering three spacious double bedrooms, ideal for working  seeking a comfortable and well-maintained home.\n\nProperty Features:\n\n    ?    3 generous double bedrooms\n    ?    Master bedroom with private en-suite\n    ?    Bright and spacious living areas\n    ?    Fully equipped kitchen\n    ?    Private outdoor space\n    ?    Quiet residential location\n    ?    Well maintained and ready to move in\n\nTenant Requirements:\n\n    ?     Professionals only    \n    ?    Non-smokers \n    ?    Minimum lease term: 6 months\n\nWe are looking for respectful, reliable tenants who will treat the property as their home.\n\nIf you are interested, please get in touch with a brief introduction about yourself, including your occupation, the number of occupants, and your preferred move-in date.\nWhat We Need From You:\n1. Identity verification\n2. Proof of income for 3 month\n3. References from the previous landlords."
      }
